# iOS-optimized MPQ load order.
# Original upstream loadorder includes d2video.mpq and d2xvideo.mpq, which:
#   1) on iOS we have no ffmpeg decoder (USE_FFMPEG=OFF), so we never play them;
#   2) on stock CD installs the user only has 1 KB placeholder copies of these,
#      which crash the engine at boot when addLoaderProvider("mpq", ...) fails.
# So we intentionally drop them here. Patch this file together with the engine
# loadorder when upstream changes.
patch_d2.mpq,d2exp.mpq,d2xmusic.mpq,d2xtalk.mpq,d2data.mpq,d2char.mpq,d2music.mpq,d2sfx.mpq,d2speech.mpq
